{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121356","id":4048841085,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7xVGl9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121356","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121356.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121356.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121356","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121356/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121356/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121356/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9ed0f0c78f581201160474c099bb2dcbcddb42de","number":121356,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add global constants to Expression","user":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nRe-adds global and Variant constant support to Expression. This script\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorScript\r\n\r\nfunc _run():\r\n\tvar expr = Expression.new()\r\n\tfor k in [\r\n\t\t\"Color()\",\r\n\t\t\"Vector2()\",\r\n\t\t\"Color(1,1,1,1).darkened(0.5)\",\r\n\t\t\"Vector2(0,0).distance_to(Vector2(1,1))\",\r\n\t\t# the following won't work\r\n\t\t\"KEY_ESCAPE\",\r\n\t\t\"Color.WHITE\",\r\n\t\t\"Vector2.ZERO\",\r\n\t\t\"Color.WHITE.darkened(0.5)\",\r\n\t\t\"Vector2.ZERO.distance_to(Vector2.ONE)\",\r\n\t\t]:\r\n\t\tif expr.parse(k) == OK:\r\n\t\t\tprints(\"\\\"%s\\\": %s\" % [k, expr.execute()])\r\n\t\telse:\r\n\t\t\tprint(\"(ERROR) \\\"%s\\\": %s\" % [k, expr.get_error_text()])\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nnow works correctly. On master:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n\"Color()\": (0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)\r\n\"Vector2()\": (0.0, 0.0)\r\n\"Color(1,1,1,1).darkened(0.5)\": (0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0)\r\n\"Vector2(0,0).distance_to(Vector2(1,1))\": 1.41421353816986\r\n  ERROR: self can't be used because instance is null (not passed)\r\n\"KEY_ESCAPE\": <null>\r\n(ERROR) \"Color.WHITE\": Expected '('\r\n(ERROR) \"Vector2.ZERO\": Expected '('\r\n(ERROR) \"Color.WHITE.darkened(0.5)\": Expected '('\r\n(ERROR) \"Vector2.ZERO.distance_to(Vector2.ONE)\": Expected '('\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n\"Color()\": (0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0)\r\n\"Vector2()\": (0.0, 0.0)\r\n\"Color(1,1,1,1).darkened(0.5)\": (0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0)\r\n\"Vector2(0,0).distance_to(Vector2(1,1))\": 1.41421353816986\r\n\"KEY_ESCAPE\": 4194305\r\n\"Color.WHITE\": (1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0)\r\n\"Vector2.ZERO\": (0.0, 0.0)\r\n\"Color.WHITE.darkened(0.5)\": (0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0)\r\n\"Vector2.ZERO.distance_to(Vector2.ONE)\": 1.41421353816986\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Closes #60066\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nConstant resolving could be pushed to execution time, but I think this is fine\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106542*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-14T00:47:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T11:00:45Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T11:00:23Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"58b9b70806d1446f3b1dfdc7c48629be17a29d60","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"sockeye-d:constants-in-expressions","ref":"constants-in-expressions","repo":{"id":828030930,"node_id":"R_kgDOMVq_0g","name":"godot","full_name":"sockeye-d/godot","owner":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owne